# Data warehouse

Data warehouse is relational database mangement system(RDBMS) designed for query and analysis. it stores historcal data derived from transaction of data. it is a database that store information that is useful decision making, so it can also be described as centralized data repository.
Data warehouse supports architecture that is useful making business related decisions.

Data warehouse environment contains an extraction, transportation, loading(ETL), an online analytical processing engine, customer analysis tool and other applications that handle the process of gathering information and delivering.